@description ReaMole: Soundmole Extension for REAPER
@version 0.0.42
@author zaibuyidao
@donation https://www.paypal.me/zaibuyidao
@provides
  [darwin64      ] ReaMole/reaper_reamole-x86_64.dylib > reaper_reamole-x86_64.dylib
  [darwin-arm64  ] ReaMole/reaper_reamole-arm64.dylib  > reaper_reamole-arm64.dylib
  [linux64       ] ReaMole/reaper_reamole-x86_64.so    > reaper_reamole-x86_64.so
  [linux-aarch64 ] ReaMole/reaper_reamole-aarch64.so   > reaper_reamole-aarch64.so
  [win64         ] ReaMole/reaper_reamole-x64.dll      > reaper_reamole-x64.dll
@changelog
  Updated ReaMole extension to v0.0.42.
  Renamed extension binaries from reaper_soundmole-* to reaper_reamole-*.